    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      451.01,
      538.37,
      611.95
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 05.30 a.m. on 16 September 2026. The low-level atmospheric disturbance is moving away from Sri Lanka. Therefore, its influence is expected to gradually decrease. Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in the Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central and Southern provinces. Fairly heavy falls about 75 mm are likely at some places. Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places in Uva, Eastern and North central provinces and in Mullaittivu district after 1.00 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      615.88,
      538.13,
      702.39
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
